{
  "text": "```verilog\nmodule sync_wedge #(\n    parameter STAGES = 2\n)(\n    input  clk_i,\n    input  rst_ni,\n    input  en_i,\n    input  serial_i,\n    output r_edge_o,\n    output f_edge_o,\n    output serial_o\n);\n\n    // Synchronizer chain\n    reg [STAGES-1:0] sync_reg;\n\n    // Edge detection registers\n    reg serial_d1;\n    reg serial_d2;\n\n    // Synchronized output\n    assign serial_o = sync_reg[STAGES-1];\n\n    // Synchronizer\n    always @(posedge clk_i or negedge rst_ni) begin\n        if (!rst_ni)\n            sync_reg <= {STAGES{1'b0}};\n        else\n            sync_reg <= {sync_reg[STAGES-2:0], serial_i};\n    end\n\n    // Edge detection\n    always @(posedge clk_i or negedge rst_ni) begin\n        if (!rst_ni) begin\n            serial_d1 <= 1'b0;\n            serial_d2 <= 1'b0;\n        end\n        else begin\n            serial_d1 <= serial_o;\n            serial_d2 <= serial_d1;\n        end\n    end\n\n    // Rising edge: current is 1, previous was 0\n    assign r_edge_o = en_i & serial_o & ~serial_d1;\n\n    // Falling edge: current is 0, previous was 1\n    assign f_edge_o = en_i & ~serial_o & serial_d1;\n\nendmodule\n```<|im_end|>",
